 with an orange border, two silver metal buckets with black handles on the ground, a red brick wall to the left, dark gray metal railings with white protective netting to the right, and sunlight casting clear railing shadows on light gray tile floors.\n<Picture 4> is a reference for a bedroom scene viewed from a doorway, with a dark surface in the foreground featuring cartoon panda and character stickers.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 15-second real estate introduction featuring <Subject 1> walking through and introducing rooms based on the environments shown in <Picture 2>, <Picture 3>, and <Picture 4>. <Picture 1> serves as the first-frame anchor for the character's appearance and the initial scene setting.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears throughout [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - the woman's identity, deep brown long wavy hair, dark green double-breasted blazer and pants, emerald jewelry, watch, and stated physical attributes (170cm/55kg) are retained.\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - the initial seated composition, character appearance, sofa, lamp, and window setting are established from this anchor.\n<Picture 2> (living room environment): fully_preserved - the TV console, side table, artwork, chair, floor, lighting, and window with curtains are incorporated into the living room shot.\n<Picture 3> (balcony environment): fully_preserved - the drying rack with towels, buckets, brick wall, railings, netting, and floor with sunlight shadows are incorporated into the balcony shot.\n<Picture 4> (bedroom doorway view): fully_preserved - the bedroom scene viewed from the doorway is incorporated into the final bedroom shot.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a cinematic live-action style with realistic indoor lighting, shallow depth of field, and camera specs of Sony A1, 85mm f/1.4, 4K ultra-clear resolution. The young woman (<Subject 1>) maintains a fixed facial structure, natu